<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-RBA says inflation needs  eternal vigilance.</title>
<headline>RTRS-RBA says inflation needs  eternal vigilance.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) deputy governor Stephen Grenville said on Friday eternal vigilance was needed to maintain price stability.</p>
<p>&quot;The price of price stability is eternal vigilance,&quot; Grenville told a Committee for Economic Development of Australia (CEDA) conference.</p>
</text>
